# Image resolver provider keys.
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the values you want enabled.
# All providers gracefully no-op when their key is missing — the resolver
# falls through to the next source (Wikipedia → curated fallback).

# Unsplash (browser-friendly, search-by-text).
# Get a key: https://unsplash.com/developers
# VITE_UNSPLASH_KEY=

# Google Places (production needs a small server proxy because direct
# browser calls are blocked by CORS). Set the proxy base URL below;
# the proxy is expected to expose `GET /photo?query=...` returning
# `{ image_url: "..." }`.
# VITE_PLACES_PROXY_URL=
# VITE_GOOGLE_PLACES_KEY=

# Anthropic key — when wiring Claude into lib/ai/generateTrip.js.
# VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Base URL for the auth/API server (server/). Defaults to localhost:4000/api
# when unset; override here if you proxy through a different host in dev.
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:4000/api
